{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941990/extras/4bf8ac60ccb6bc815f4935ce77e5b309.avif?t=1760061858\" alt=\"Capsule art for Unhomely, showing the game logo next to a silhouetted person standing outside a modern cabin lit by eerie red light from the interior surrounded by dark green forest.\" width=800 height=281 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the remote wilderness of New Zealand, a beautiful forest cabin hides an unspeakable horror this billionaire doesn't want you to find.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>YOUR NEXT BIG STORY!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Blair Ward \u2014 a down on her luck journalist chasing a once in a lifetime opportunity - is it too good to be true?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941990/extras/e26fcd5a448dc989fd948b0cb4c90060.avif?t=1760061858\" data-has-big width=1600 height=666 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After over a year hidden from the public eye, reclusive tech CEO Tom Ballinger, pioneer of revolutionary &quot;fungus powered&quot; technology, has invited <i>YOU</i> to his isolated estate in the New Zealand wilderness for an exclusive interview and a glimpse of his next big project.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Away at a conference, he allows you to stay in his woodland cabin, all alone... Though he won't stop texting you strange requests...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941990/extras/a8ff9f213d9f8de796fa3bc97609df13.avif?t=1760061858\" width=1240 height=590 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have three days before the interview.\u00a0Just you, your phone camera, and a property full of secrets, waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might be able to save your career, but can you save yourself from what you find?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENJOY YOUR STAY\u2026</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941990/extras/73d9f6ccc6342ece62ee95e9c8c6babc.avif?t=1760061858\" data-has-big width=1600 height=784 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate</strong> - Explore Ballinger's cabin, taking photos with your phone and documenting discoveries on your clue board.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel</strong> - Follow the clues and slowly unravel the mystery of Tom's &quot;innovative&quot; mycelial technology and his strange behaviour.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expose</strong> - Find out the truth behind his next big project, and expose it for the world to see... if you can make it out alive.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric setting with a lo-fi pixelated aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive clue board system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phone camera and torch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive texts from NPCs</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2941990?t=1760061858","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941990/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760061858","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941990/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760061858","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941990/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760061858","categories":[{"description"