2941990/extras/a8ff9f213d9f8de796fa3bc97609df13.avif?t=1760061858\" width=1240 height=590 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have three days before the interview.\u00a0Just you, your phone camera, and a property full of secrets, waiting to be uncovered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might be able to save your career, but can you save yourself from what you find?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENJOY YOUR STAY\u2026</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941990/extras/73d9f6ccc6342ece62ee95e9c8c6babc.avif?t=1760061858\" data-has-big width=1600 height=784 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigate</strong> - Explore Ballinger's cabin, taking photos with your phone and documenting discoveries on your clue board.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unravel</strong> - Follow the clues and slowly unravel the mystery of Tom's &quot;innovative&quot; mycelial technology and his strange behaviour.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expose</strong> - Find out the truth behind his next big project, and expose it for the world to see... if you can make it out alive.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric setting with a lo-fi pixelated aesthetic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive clue board system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phone camera and torch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive texts from NPCs</p></li></ul>","developers":["Studio 8-Track"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2941990/header.jpg?t=1760061858","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Min